  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as a single automaton, capturing all possible uncontrollable sensor outcomes and controllable actions. The specification enforces safe, conservative obstacle avoidance, ensures forward/random_walk exploration in clear states, and mandates recovery turns or full_rotate only when obstacles are detected. It prevents unsafe actions in obstacle states and ensures rapid return to exploration after recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Plant G1 encodes all motion and perception as a single automaton, ensuring every state is total on uncontrollables and enables exactly one controllable in each non-terminal state.",
